{"id":1759168,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-31T18:23:04.575Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1759168,"imdb_id":"tt2066162","origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Winter Sports: Swiss Snow Sports","overview":"A great variety of the Swiss snow sports are here shown. Commencing with toboganning round a steep circular descent, and next in increasing numbers down a precipitous incline, ladies and gentlemen in singles and pairs, several carrying flags and other trophies as they whisk merrily past. Still toboganning at high speed, they next engage in many games-grab apple, tilting at the ring, cleaving the champagne bottle, &c., and in these the lady competitors, who are numerous, show up to great advantage. In the final bout, where mixed couples come down together and \"dump\" into a huge snow heap at great velocity, the fun is brought to a climax.","popularity":0,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[{"id":44771,"logo_path":"/bfyrVfFnmmcanicDhqD9PNxbUHw.png","name":"Charles Urban Trading Company","origin_country":"GB"}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"GB","name":"United Kingdom"}],"release_date":"1906-03-17","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"No Language","iso_639_1":"xx","name":"No Language"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Winter Sports: Swiss Snow Sports","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[{"iso_3166_1":"DK","title":"Vintersport i Schweiz","type":""}]},"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":3420885,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Frank Ormiston-Smith","original_name":"Frank Ormiston-Smith","popularity":0.495,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6a94ed942b75eafdb9b12d9f","department":"Crew","job":"Cinematography"}]},"images":{"backdrops":[],"logos":[],"posters":[]},"external_ids":{"imdb_id":"tt20661